phase 6.3 exchange resolution and admission controls:
- Added validated ResolutionLimits with documented hard maxima and wired configured values into the exchange admission ledger.
- Changed request idempotency digest to hash the exact canonical Resolve body.
- Added a fallible injected ticket-ID source seam and regression coverage for randomness failure without issuance.
- Added guarded exchange controls for first cached successful-response drop and bounded response hold, plus privacy-safe fault lifecycle event.
- Added resolver negative-cache supplied-clock decisions, short-circuiting, FIFO promotion ordering, queue/cache counters, and expiry regression coverage.
